# Built from the board, never committed (cad/PCB-AND-3D-GUIDE.md step 8): renders, the STEP, DRC/ERC
# reports, router round-trip files. The schematic SVG and the BOM CSV are the reviewable forms and stay.
*.step
*-top.png
*-bottom.png
*.dsn
*.ses
*.rules
*-drc.json
# The enclosure (Y7): make_enclosure.py rebuilds its STEP and STL from board.json and the board
# STEP in one command, so the outputs are generated files and stay out of git (CLAUDE.md §1).
enclosure/*.step
enclosure/*.stl
